+#### [SlicerCBCTToothSegmentation](https://github.com/KitwareMedical/SlicerCBCTToothSegmentation)
+> **Description:** This repository provides a 3D Slicer extension for CBCT tooth segmentation, which is directly relevant to endodontic, orthodontic, and oral surgery workflows. The README positions it as an extension rather than a standalone imaging stack, which is useful because it fits into a broader Slicer deployment without forcing a separate interface. Its scope is narrower than general radiology viewers, but that specialization is exactly why it matters for dentists. GitHub lists it as Python, Apache-2.0 licensed, lightly starred, and updated on 2024-10-23.
