+- **License:** MIT
+- **Last Commit:** 2025-11-14
+- **Category:** web-viewer, dicom
+- **Best for:** Browser-based dental image review and remote collaboration on DICOM studies
+
+---
+
+#### [pydicom](https://github.com/pydicom/pydicom)
+> **Description:** `pydicom` is the core Python toolkit for reading, modifying, and writing DICOM files, which makes it foundational for dental CBCT preprocessing, anonymization, metadata cleanup, and pipeline scripting. The README is intentionally focused on DICOM datasets and Pythonic APIs rather than end-user UI, so it fits best in engineering-heavy dental teams or research labs. Many other DICOM utilities build on this library. GitHub lists Python as primary, about 2,153 stars, an MIT license, and repository activity updated on 2026-03-20.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/pydicom/pydicom](https://github.com/pydicom/pydicom)
