+> **Description:** Whisper is the reference open-source speech recognition model for many healthcare and practice-management experiments. The README highlights multilingual speech recognition, translation, and language identification in one sequence-to-sequence model, which makes it useful for treatment notes, voicemail transcription, and clinician dictation. It is not dental-specific, but its robustness and community adoption make it one of the safest baselines for a self-hosted dental transcription stack. GitHub lists Python, MIT licensing, about 92,100 stars, and a visible latest release in mid-2025.
