+
+> Best AI tools for dentists in 2026 still skew heavily toward imaging, transcription, and self-hosted workflow infrastructure rather than dentist-only SaaS products. This list focuses only on public GitHub repositories, with dental-specific projects first and adjacent open source stacks second, so dental clinics, labs, and researchers can evaluate practical tools without proprietary lock-in.
