+> **Description:** `deep-dental-image` implements Mask R-CNN-based instance segmentation for panoramic X-ray images and is one of the clearer public repos focused on panoramic dental radiographs. The README ties the code to a published segmentation paper and shows notebook-driven experimentation, annotation handling, and model evaluation around teeth detection in panoramic studies. It is more academic than productized, but still relevant for dental AI prototyping and benchmarking. GitHub lists roughly 89 stars, Python as the primary language, MIT licensing, and visible public activity during 2024.
