+#### [pynetdicom](https://github.com/pydicom/pynetdicom)
+> **Description:** `pynetdicom` implements DICOM networking in Python, covering the transport and protocol layer that clinics need when moving studies between scanners, PACS, viewers, and analysis services. The README keeps the focus on protocol support and application entities, which makes it a good companion to `pydicom` for dental imaging systems that need actual network exchange instead of offline file work only. It is a lower-level tool, but very useful in real integrations. GitHub shows Python, MIT licensing, about 554 stars, and visible updates on 2026-03-07.
