+> **Description:** WhisperLive wraps Whisper into a nearly live transcription workflow with server and client components, so it is better suited than the base model for real-time dictation use cases. The README focuses on live microphone input, pre-recorded audio handling, browser extensions, and Dockerized deployment, all of which lower the barrier for a small clinic IT setup. It is a strong fit for real-time chairside notes or front-desk call support where latency matters. GitHub lists Python, MIT licensing, about 3,700 stars, and updates on 2025-09-25.
